* Integrated SC + telescopic OTA + input common-mode correction
**.subckt corrected_differential_sc
XOTA sumn sump outp outn ota_vdd 0 bias vref vbn vbp ota_telescopic_cm2p5
CMEMP 0 sensp %%cp%%p
XSENSEP sensp txp phi2 phi2b vdd 0 corrected_tg
XSRESETP sensp 0 phi1 phi1b vdd 0 corrected_tg
XCHARGEP vp txp phi1 phi1b vdd 0 corrected_tg
CSP txp rxp 10p
XRRESETP rxp 0 phi1 phi1b vdd 0 corrected_tg
XXFERP rxp sump phit phitb vdd 0 corrected_tg
XCFP sump outp corrected_pmos_bank
XFBRESETP sump outp phi1 phi1b vdd 0 corrected_tg
CLP outp 0 5p
CMEMN 0 sensn %%cn%%p
XSENSEN sensn txn phi2 phi2b vdd 0 corrected_tg
XSRESETN 0 sensn phi1 phi1b vdd 0 corrected_tg
XCHARGEN txn vp phi1 phi1b vdd 0 corrected_tg
CSN txn rxn 10p
XRRESETN 0 rxn phi1 phi1b vdd 0 corrected_tg
XXFERN rxn sumn phit phitb vdd 0 corrected_tg
XCFN sumn outn corrected_pmos_bank
XFBRESETN sumn outn phi1 phi1b vdd 0 corrected_tg
CLN 0 outn 5p

CSMPp holdp 0 10p
CSMPn holdn 0 10p
MN_tr_p outp tr holdp 0 N W=10u L=.8u AD=45p AS=45p PD=29u PS=29u
MP_tr_p outp trb holdp vdd P W=7.5u L=.8u AD=33.75p AS=33.75p PD=49u PS=49u
MN_pr_p acq_ref pr holdp 0 N W=10u L=.8u AD=45p AS=45p PD=29u PS=29u
MP_pr_p acq_ref prb holdp vdd P W=20u L=.8u AD=90p AS=90p PD=49u PS=49u
MN_tr_n outn tr holdn 0 N W=10u L=.8u AD=45p AS=45p PD=29u PS=29u
MP_tr_n outn trb holdn vdd P W=7.5u L=.8u AD=33.75p AS=33.75p PD=49u PS=49u
MN_pr_n acq_ref pr holdn 0 N W=10u L=.8u AD=45p AS=45p PD=29u PS=29u
MP_pr_n acq_ref prb holdn vdd P W=20u L=.8u AD=90p AS=90p PD=49u PS=49u
RPKGp holdp pinp 5
CBOARDp pinp 0 7.01p
RBUFFERp pinp 0 100Meg
RPKGn holdn pinn 5
CBOARDn pinn 0 7.01p
RBUFFERn pinn 0 100Meg
XREFH ref_src acq_ref d2 refh_vdd 0 refbuf08
VREFHDD vdd refh_vdd 0
* The following switches represent the illustrative external ADC input.
VADC adc_sw 0 PULSE(0 1 %%adc_us%%u 1n 1n 1u 100u)
VDIS dis_sw 0 PULSE(1 0 %%dis_us%%u 1n 1n 1.3u 100u)
.model SW_ACQ SW(Ron=100 Roff=1e13 Vt=.5 Vh=.01)
CADCp adcp 0 5p
SADCp pinp adcp adc_sw 0 SW_ACQ
SDISp adcp 0 dis_sw 0 SW_ACQ
CADCn adcn 0 5p
SADCn pinn adcn adc_sw 0 SW_ACQ
SDISn adcn 0 dis_sw 0 SW_ACQ

MCORRp sump cm_x sump sump P W=20u L=10u M=40 AD=90p AS=90p PD=49u PS=49u
MCORRn sumn cm_x sumn sumn P W=20u L=10u M=40 AD=90p AS=90p PD=49u PS=49u
* Behavioral sampler and integrator. The previous sample controls this cycle.
VICMSAMPLE cm_sample 0 PULSE(0 1 %%sample_us%%u 10n 10n 2u 100u)
BICMERR 0 cm_acc I={1m*v(cm_sample)*(2.5-(v(sump)+v(sumn))/2)}
CICMINT cm_acc 0 1n
VICMSEED cm_seed 0 %%seed_voltage%%
RICMINT cm_acc cm_seed 1e13
BICMCTRL cm_ctrl 0 V={max(0,min(v(vdd),2.5+v(cm_acc)))}
VICMINIT cm_init 0 %%initial%%
RICMHOLD cm_init cm_hold 1e13
SICMHOLD cm_ctrl cm_hold phi1 0 icm_hold
.model icm_hold SW(Ron=10 Roff=1e14 Vt=2 Vh=.1)
CICMHOLD cm_hold 0 20p
* Hold the correction until reset. Stage it with the two transfer events.
.model icm_edge_set SW(Ron=3000 Roff=1e13 Vt=1 Vh=.05)
.model icm_edge_reset SW(Ron=100k Roff=1e13 Vt=2 Vh=.1)
SICMEDGE1 vdd cm_edge1 phit 0 icm_edge_set
SICMEDGE2 vdd cm_edge2 phi2 0 icm_edge_set
SICMRST1 cm_edge1 0 phi1 0 icm_edge_reset
SICMRST2 cm_edge2 0 phi1 0 icm_edge_reset
CICMEDGE1 cm_edge1 0 10p
CICMEDGE2 cm_edge2 0 10p
BICMDRIVE cm_x 0 V={((.68*v(cm_edge1)+.32*v(cm_edge2))/max(.1,v(vdd)))*v(cm_hold)}

**** begin user architecture code
.include "support.spice"
**** end user architecture code
**.ends
.end
